cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "ai-augmented-cases (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  One case per real project run with the AI-augmented method: what it cost and what it produced, measured where a program can measure it from the repository's history. A first review, a shape and two cases are written.
type: software
authors:
